#. module: boardkit_dashboard_account
#: model:boardkit.dashboard.template,description:boardkit_dashboard_account.template_account_invoicing
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Finance-oriented invoicing board: billed amount, outstanding and\n"
"            overdue AR, credit notes, collected amount, collection rate, amount\n"
"            trends, payment status, top customers and a recent invoices list.\n"
"            Aggregates use the signed company-currency amounts, so figures can\n"
"            be compared across currencies and credit notes count as negative.\n"
"            Requires Invoicing.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"            Tablero de facturacion orientado a finanzas: monto facturado, cuentas por cobrar\n"
"            pendientes y vencidas, notas de credito, monto cobrado, tasa de cobranza,\n"
"            tendencias de montos, estado de pago, principales clientes y lista de\n"
"            facturas recientes. Los agregados usan montos firmados en la moneda de\n"
"            la compania, por lo que las cifras se pueden comparar entre monedas y\n"
"            las notas de credito se consideran negativas. Requiere Facturacion.\n"
"        "

